sentences.l:
for not her before to cease I think
from weeping hateful and from lamentation tearful,
before me myself she sees;

And him by far first saw the nurse Eurycleia,
fleeces spreading on chairs wrought,
and, having wept, then straight went;

if me the lordly suitors in the halls
secretly killing, all my father’s goods should divide,
yourself having them I wish to enjoy, rather than any of these;

And hand-water a handmaid poured over them, bringing it in a pitcher,
a fine golden one, over a silver basin,
for washing;
